# Kang the Conqueror: "Power-up — {5}{U}{U}{U}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Kang. Take an extra turn after this one. During that
# turn, power-up abilities can't be activated." Kang enters on turn 1, so his power-up costs his mana cost less: {3}{U}
# (CR 702.193b), paid with Mox Sapphire's {U}, Sol Ring's {C}{C} and the {C} left of Mana Crypt. He gets his counter and
# Bot1 takes turn 2. There Bot1 casts Ultron Drone, whose power-up would cost only {3} the turn it enters, and is refused
# it: power-up abilities can't be activated (CR 602.5) in the extra turn. Bot2 has turn 3. On turn 4 the same ability is
# activated, at its full {6}, so the restriction ended with the extra turn.

